<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Congratulations - Next Steps</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #1d4ed8 100%); padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center;">
            {{#if companyLogo}}
            <img src="{{companyLogo}}" alt="{{organizationName}}" style="max-height: 50px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            {{/if}}
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600;">🎉 Congratulations!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div style="padding: 40px 30px;">
            <h2 style="color: #2563eb; margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">
                Great news, {{candidateName}}!
            </h2>
            
            <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; font-size: 16px; color: #374151;">
                We're excited to inform you that you've been selected to advance to the next stage of our hiring process for the <strong style="color: #2563eb;">{{jobTitle}}</strong> position at {{organizationName}}.
            </p>
            
            <!-- Progress Indicator -->
            <div style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f3f4f6 0%, #e5e7eb 100%); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 25px 0; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                    <span style="background-color: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Next Step</span>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1f2937; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">
                    {{capitalize nextStageName}}
                </h3>
                {{#if stageDescription}}
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    <strong>What to expect:</strong> {{stageDescription}}
                </p>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
            
            {{#if notes}}
            <div style="background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid #f59e0b; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #92400e; font-size: 14px;">
                    <strong>Additional Information:</strong> {{notes}}
                </p>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
            
            <p style="margin: 20px 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                Our hiring team will be in touch within the next 1-2 business days with detailed information about your next interview, including:
            </p>
            
            <ul style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Interview date and time options</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Format details (in-person, video call, etc.)</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Who you'll be meeting with</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">What to prepare or bring</li>
            </ul>
            
            <div style="background-color: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #0c4a6e; font-size: 15px; text-align: center;">
                    <strong>💡 Pro Tip:</strong> Start preparing now by reviewing the job description and thinking about specific examples from your experience that demonstrate your qualifications.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin: 25px 0 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px;">
                We're looking forward to learning more about you and discussing how you can contribute to our team!
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #374151; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">
                Best regards,
            </p>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px;">
                {{organizationName}} Hiring Team
            </p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;">
                    This email was sent regarding your application for {{jobTitle}}.<br>
                    If you have any questions, please contact our HR team.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
